{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "laravel-business-api-translations",
		"name": "Laravel Business API - Translations",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Laravel Business Directory with multilingual support (English & Arabic)\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require Bearer token authentication. Use the login endpoint to get a token.\n\n## Translation Support\n- Send `Accept-Language: en` for English\n- Send `Accept-Language: ar` for Arabic\n- Default locale is English if no header is provided\n\n## Translation Fields\nWhen creating/updating records, you can send translation fields:\n- `title` and `description_translations` for Businesses\n- `question_translations` and `answer_translations` for FAQs\n\nExample:\n```json\n{\n  \"description_translations\": {\n    \"en\": \"English description\",\n    \"ar\": \"الوصف بالعربية\"\n  }\n}\n```",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					""
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					""
				]
			}
		}
	],
